window.RP_SESSION={"id":"S-86aad3711659","messages":[{"id":"RP-0136139","time":"2026-04-29T13:09:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"분명 우리 언젠가 다시 스칠 날이 있겠지만\n그땐 서로 모른 척 지나가겠죠?","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136140","time":"2026-04-29T13:09:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"사진","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136141","time":"2026-04-29T13:09:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"그런 때가 오더라도.\n그 때까진 잘 지내요 우리.","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136142","time":"2026-04-29T13:10:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"사진","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136143","time":"2026-04-29T13:10:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"안녕 숀.\n잘 지내세요.","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136144","time":"2026-04-29T13:10:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"사진","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136145","time":"2026-04-29T13:12:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"맑은 날입니다.\n시원한 바람이 불어올 때마다 비단 잔디가 스치는 소리도 싱그럽습니다.\n\n\" 음~... \"\n\n쩝.\n\n숀은 낡은 울타리에 앉아 조용히 편지를 읽었습니다.","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136146","time":"2026-04-29T13:13:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 결국 이렇게 됐군! \"\n\n하사관 아넬라의 이별 편지입니다.\n\n잠시 편지 든 손을 내려놓고\n\n턱을 괴어 언덕을 바라봅니다.","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136147","time":"2026-04-29T13:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 그래~! 엿까라마이신이다 그래~! 너만 여자냐!? 세상 반이 여자라고! \"\n\n욕도 한 번 해봤지만 \n\n기분이 나아질 리 없습니다.\n\n\" ... 흠. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136148","time":"2026-04-29T13:18:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"차였나요?\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136149","time":"2026-04-29T13:21:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" ㅁ, 므ㅕ여 깜-딱이야. \"\n\n깜짝...!\n\n숀은 편지를 구깃, 쥐며 뒤를 돌아봤습니다.\n\n\" 뭐야, 여기. 나 말고 또 돌아다니는 사람이 있었네. \"\n\n코를 한 번 슥 훑었습니다.","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136150","time":"2026-04-29T13:21:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"전, 어디든 돌아다니니깐요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136151","time":"2026-04-29T13:21:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"돌아다니는게 업이라서요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136152","time":"2026-04-29T13:25:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 그래? \"\n\n몰려온 잠깐의 창피함, 당혹감은 뭍 위로 부서지는 파도처럼 빠르게 식었습니다.\n\n숀은 고개를 돌려 언덕 위에 있는 나무 한 그루를 쳐다봤습니다.\n\n\" 그래.\n\n... 그렇게 됐네. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136153","time":"2026-04-29T13:26:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"숀은.. 애인이 가지고 싶은건가요?\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136154","time":"2026-04-29T13:29:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 음~...엄... \"\n\n퐁...!\n\n숀의 호숫가에 돌멩이 하나가 던져집니다.\n\n\" 잘 모르겠네 -.- 사랑할 대상이 필요한 건쥐. 그냥 애인이 가지고 싶은건쥐.\n\n다른 사람들은 어떤 생각으로 사랑들을 하는거람. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136155","time":"2026-04-29T13:32:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"리스도, 숀의 옆에 쭈그려 안아 돌맹이를 만지작 거리며 고릅니다..\n\n\"그 점은 공감이 되네요.. 다른 사람들은 어떤 생각으로 사랑을 하는 걸까요\"\n\n\"왜, 서로에게 서로가 필요한걸까요\"\n\n\"숀\"\n\n\"저 어제 고백을 받은거 같은데\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136156","time":"2026-04-29T13:34:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 이여~ 횡재했네. 부자야? \"\n\n건조한 농담이 뒤따랐습니다.\n\n그러면서도 무심한 얼굴로 폴라리스를 따라 돌멩이를 고릅니다.\n\n\" 그런데? \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136157","time":"2026-04-29T13:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아뇨, 토르번이요\"\n\n\"그리고 찼어요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136158","time":"2026-04-29T13:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 잘했네. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136159","time":"2026-04-29T13:35:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"잘한건가요?\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136160","time":"2026-04-29T13:37:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"그래요. 그렇게 말했습니다.\n\n'잘했네.'\n\n그리곤 폴라리스의 되물음에,\n\n' 그건 모르쥐. '\n\n하고 답했습니다.\n\n\" 잘했다고. 걜 찬게 좋고 나쁜단게 아니라.\n\n어쨋든 네가 결단을 내렸다는거니까.\n\n잘 되었다고. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136161","time":"2026-04-29T13:38:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"결단... 결단인진 잘 모르겠어요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136162","time":"2026-04-29T13:38:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그냥, 그냥 맞지 않다고 생각했을 뿐이에요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136163","time":"2026-04-29T13:39:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"사람들은 왜 연인을 만드는 걸까요?\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136164","time":"2026-04-29T13:40:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"어차피 토르번이든,... 누구든, 끝까지 제 곁에 있어줄건 아니잖아요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136165","time":"2026-04-29T13:40:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그리고 제가 누구의 곁에 머무를 바람이 아니란것도요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136166","time":"2026-04-29T13:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 글쎄에, 혼기가 차서 --? \"\n\n무슨 기준으로 고른 돌멩인지는 모르겠지만, 숀은 폴라리스 앞에 돌멩이들을 하나 둘 골라서 가져다둡니다.\n\n\" 아님, 같이 밥 먹으면서 농담도 하고. 뭐 일 끝나고 집에들어오면 잘 지냈냐, 뭐했냐 그런, 시시콜콜하고 사소한 얘길 나눌..  \"\n\n음.\n\n본인도 얘길 하다보니 뭔가\n\n\" 온정 나눌 사람이 적어서? \"\n\n묘한 기분이 드네요 숀.","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136167","time":"2026-04-29T13:43:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"헤일리","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"뜨끔.","characters":["P-978c6ca18f92"]},{"id":"RP-0136168","time":"2026-04-29T13:44:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"헤일리","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":" \"뭐... 사람이 늘 다른 사람 곁에 있을 수 있나요? 결국 모두 혼잔데.\"\n\n 혼기 다 차도 아직 모쏠인 여자.","characters":["P-978c6ca18f92"]},{"id":"RP-0136169","time":"2026-04-29T13:44:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" ㅁ뭐야 깜짝이야 \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136170","time":"2026-04-29T13:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 여긴 다들 어떻게 찾아 오는거야 --? \"\n\n땀이 삐질.\n동네가 이거 동네가, 비밀이 없는 동네로구만.\n\n\" 아 가봐- 진대중이니깐. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136171","time":"2026-04-29T13:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"하하\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136172","time":"2026-04-29T13:45:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"맞아요, 다 혼자인데\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136173","time":"2026-04-29T13:46:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"왜... 사랑을 하는걸까요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136174","time":"2026-04-29T13:46:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"솔직하게, 토르번이 했던, 그 기대가 조금 무거워 보여서\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136175","time":"2026-04-29T13:46:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"도망친걸지도 모르겠네요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136176","time":"2026-04-29T13:48:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"헤일리","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":" \"외롭잖아요. 계속 혼자면. 듬성한 따뜻함으로도 체온은 오르니까.\"\n\n 전 다시 일하러 북부로 갑니다~. 안녕히계세요~","characters":["P-978c6ca18f92"]},{"id":"RP-0136177","time":"2026-04-29T13:50:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 신기한 녀석이로군 --; \"\n\n숀은 쫄쫄쫄 걸어가는 헤일리를 보며 얘기했습니다.\n\n그리곤 돌멩이를 하나 더 고르기 시작합니다.\n\n\" 난 나쁘지 않다고 생각해. 도망치는거.\n\n...근데, 가끔은 본인이 도망치는 줄도 모르고 도망치는 사람들이 있거든.\n\n적어도 넌 그렇진 않은 것 같애.\n\n그냥, 상처 주기가 싫은거쥐. 또. 받는것도. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136178","time":"2026-04-29T13:52:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 그니까, \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136179","time":"2026-04-29T13:52:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 아니아니, 그러니까. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136180","time":"2026-04-29T13:53:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 잘했네. \"\n\n이번엔 자기가 잘 고른 돌멩이를 갖습니다.","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136181","time":"2026-04-29T13:53:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 잘되었어. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136182","time":"2026-04-29T13:56:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"퐁.\n\n숀이 골라준 돌은 아름다운 기하학적 모양의 물결을 만들곤 호수 아래로 가라앉았습니다.\n\n\"잘된걸까요\"\n\n잘한걸까, 그래. 그냥 그러면 된걸지도 몰라.\n하나하나 내려 놓다보면, 이곳에 왔을 때 처럼 아무것도 없는\n가벼워, 날아가버릴 것 같던 그 때로.. 돌아가는 걸까.","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136183","time":"2026-04-29T13:58:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 근데. 그 뒤가 중요하쥐 않겠어? 도망친 다음 말이야. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136184","time":"2026-04-29T13:58:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"뒤?\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136185","time":"2026-04-29T14:02:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 엉. 뒤. \"\n\n뒤.\n\n\" 나는 모든 도망에는 이유가 있다고 생각하거든. 그리고 그 이유는 '더 잘 하고 싶어서' 라고 생각해.\n\n더 잘. 어떻게든 잘 살아보려고. \"\n\n숀은 돌을 고르다가 마음에 들지않는 돌이 집혔는지 언덕 너머로 훽, 던졌습니다.\n\n\" 몸이...! 반응하는 가장 직관적인, 해소 방법인거쥐. 줄행랑은. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136186","time":"2026-04-29T14:03:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"... 생각 해본적 없는거 같은데요\"\n\n뒤... 죽어서도 그 뒤가 있는걸까. 왜 있는걸까","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136187","time":"2026-04-29T14:07:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" ㅋㅋㅋ \"\n\n그 얘기에 숀이 작게 웃었습니다.\n\n\" 도망도 실력이쥐. 방향이 앞이든 뒤든, 그게 도망이던 추적이던. 난 달릴 땐 꼭 정면을 본다구. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136188","time":"2026-04-29T14:08:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"음...\"\n\n\"그렇네요, 도망쳐본 적이 별로 없어서, 생각해본적 없는거 같아요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136189","time":"2026-04-29T14:09:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 그래서, 방향은 생각해봤어?\n\n북쪽, 남쪽. 고런거 말고. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136190","time":"2026-04-29T14:11:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"모르겠어요\"\n\n\".. 숀은 잘 안하고 했으니깐, 알려주면 안되요?\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136191","time":"2026-04-29T14:14:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"폴라리스의 얘기에 숀은 구깃해진 편지를 스-윽 들어보였습니다.\n\n\" 보면 모르겠어? \"\n\n\" ...  ㅋㅋㅋㅋ 나도 졸라게 튀는 중이잖아. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136192","time":"2026-04-29T14:15:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"튀는 중이였나요?\"\n\n\"차이면.. 차고 나면 끝이 아니였던거군요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136193","time":"2026-04-29T14:18:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 근데 아무리 도망쳐도 잡힐 건 결국 잡히게 되더라고. 마~악 도망쳐봤는데, 얼씨구? 알고보니 쫒아오는 건 나였어.\n\n내가 나한테 쫒기고, 나한테 도망가는 중이었던거쥐. \"\n\n다시 편지를 주머니에 넣었습니다.\n\n\" 결국은 나아간다는 선택지밖에 없었던거야. 거기가 어딘쥐는? 아직 잘 모르겠쥐만 말이쥐? \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136194","time":"2026-04-29T14:20:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"....\"\n\n\"어렵네요, 솔직히 이해 못했어요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136195","time":"2026-04-29T14:24:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 나도 그래ㅋ. 그냥 떠오르는 걸 말로 푼거지. \"\n\n숀이 작게 웃었습니다.\n\n\" 뭘, 어떻게, 왜! \"\n\n\" ... 는 잘 모르겠지만, \"\n\n그리곤 자신의 가슴을 톡톡 손가락으로 두드렸습니다.\n\n\" 네가 잘 하고 있다는 건 느껴져. ...이런걸 육감적이다라고 하나 -.-;? 아님, 경험적? 몰겠네... 무튼. \"\n\n\" 난 해야하는 걸 할 뿐야. 일단 눈 앞에 닥친 것 먼저. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136196","time":"2026-04-29T14:25:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"눈앞에 닥친것...\n\n퐁.\n\n음...\n\n\"어렵네요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136197","time":"2026-04-29T14:27:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 그리고 걘 차. 내가 보기엔 영 별로야. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136198","time":"2026-04-29T14:28:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그래요? 왜요?\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136199","time":"2026-04-29T14:36:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 뭐랄까. 사람이 좀 작위적인 것 같쥐 않아 --^? 귀족 출신이라서 그른가? \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136200","time":"2026-04-29T14:37:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"작위적?\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136201","time":"2026-04-29T14:37:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"그런가?","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136202","time":"2026-04-29T14:37:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"갸웃...","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136203","time":"2026-04-29T14:48:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 무튼, 진국은 라ㄹ... \"\n\n아차! 숀은 무언가 생각난듯 귀를 쫑긋 세웠습니다.\n\n\" 야야야, 맞아. 너 눈은 어찌된겨? 이제 다 보이는거야? \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136204","time":"2026-04-29T14:48:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"네, 이제 보여요\"","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136205","time":"2026-04-29T14:48:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"폴라리스","profile":"루체","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"싱긋","characters":["P-5d0c306440d0"]},{"id":"RP-0136206","time":"2026-04-29T14:57:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 고것 참, \"\n\n바람이 여전히 시원합니다.\n\n바람결에 출렁이는 잔디를 내려다보면 마치 물결 같습니다.\n\n쏴아아, 쏴아아.\n\n어쩐지 바람소리 조차도 파도소리처럼 들리는 것 같았습니다.\n\n\" 잘 되었어. \"","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136207","time":"2026-04-29T14:57:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"숀","profile":"Seon \"South Foot\"","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"-fin","characters":["P-5c88d36f51cd"]},{"id":"RP-0136208","time":"2026-04-29T14:57:00+09:00","room":"RP","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"... see you again, cowboy.","characters":[]}]};
